(59, 'Copper Wires', 'copper-wires', 33, 8, 3, 'a cereal grain and one of the most important staple foods in the world. It is the seed of the grass species Oryza sativa (Asian rice) or Oryza glaberr', 'Electrical wires are essential components used for transmitting electrical power and signals in residential, commercial, and industrial applications. Manufactured using high-conductivity materials such as copper or aluminum, these wires ensure efficient current flow with minimal energy loss. They are designed to provide reliable performance, durability, and long-term safety in various electrical installations.\r\nOur electrical wires are insulated with high-quality protective materials to prevent electrical leakage, short circuits, and external damage. The insulation also offers resistance against heat, moisture, chemicals, and mechanical stress, making them suitable for both indoor and outdoor use. The strong outer coating enhances flexibility while maintaining structural integrity, allowing easy installation in conduits, panels, and complex wiring systems.\r\nThese wires are available in different sizes, gauges, and current-carrying capacities to meet diverse project requirements. Whether used for lighting systems, power distribution, machinery connections, or household wiring, they deliver stable and consistent performance. Each wire is manufactured according to industry safety standards to ensure maximum protection and reliability.\r\nIdeal for electricians, contractors, builders, and DIY projects, our electrical wires provide a dependable solution for safe and efficient power transmission.', 'products/hMOb573vZ93NdmHXFPXJiP74gfzcDex4zTDeUtOt.jpg', '0.00', NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2026-02-12 00:20:55', '2026-02-17 03:06:27', NULL),
